# shadcn-only UI

`admin/` builds controls from shadcn in `@/components/ui` (style `radix-nova`). Icons come from `lucide-react`. Tailwind utilities are for layout and spacing.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — second library, or a custom button
import { Button } from "@mui/material";
<button className="rounded bg-blue-500 px-4">Save</button>

// ✅ GOOD
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
<Button type="submit">Save</Button>
```

- Do not add MUI, Chakra, Ant Design, Bootstrap, or Headless UI.
- Do not hand-roll buttons, inputs, selects, dialogs, tables, badges, switches, or tabs.
- Radix belongs only inside generated files in `components/ui`.
- App chrome (`layouts/`, page sections, `components/` outside `ui/`) stays outside those primitives.
